  "description": "Everyone dies. Death by aging. Death by accident. Death by…homicide. Three murderers know this final death all too well. One kills for art, one for a reason, and one kills for the taste. Offered a contract by an enigmatic company, they may kill in any manner they desire so long as they leave the bodies for…harvesting.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
